Description: Reuse dbus menuitems more aggressively.
 There are two issues here that prevent submenus from working great:
 .
  * The first one is that the about-to-show signal in libdbusmenu
    is supposed to be sync, but it's not [1].
  * The other one is that some clients don't re-fetch submenus
    when they're open.
 .
 So we don't have a great way to update our submenus other than
 trying to reuse the already existing items it seems...
 .
 [1]: https://github.com/JetBrains/libdbusmenu/blob/38d7a2ada4b2a08c535491d43a39825868f2b065/libdbusmenu-glib/server.c#L1835-L1839
